<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cbank sell and buy tender av yield 18.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cbank sell and buy tender av yield 18.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Tuesday that the average and maximum yield in its three-day &quot;sell and buy&quot; tender was 18.5 percent.</p>
<p>The CNB added that 67 percent of bids were accepted at the maximum rate in the tender whose minimum yield was 18.43 percent.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
